@base = http://localhost:5080
@token = cole-o-token-do-login-aqui

### Registrar
POST {{base}}/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Adriano", "email": "adriano@exemplo.com", "senha": "uma-senha-longa-123" }

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "adriano@exemplo.com", "senha": "uma-senha-longa-123" }

### Criar cliente
POST {{base}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Imobiliária Exemplo", "documento": "12.ABC.345/01DE-35", "email": "contato@exemplo.com" }

### Criar contrato IPCA com teto de 10%
POST {{base}}/api/contratos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "COLE-O-ID-DO-CLIENTE",
  "descricao": "Aluguel sala 101",
  "valorInicial": 2500.00,
  "dataBase": "2025-03-10",
  "tipoIndice": "Ipca",
  "teto": 10,
  "unidadeLimite": "Percentual",
  "naoReduzir": true
}

### Listar contratos
GET {{base}}/api/contratos?busca=sala&tipoIndice=Ipca&status=Ativo&pagina=1&tamanhoPagina=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
